        "name": "Disdain",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Urgot charges in a direction, shielding himself and trampling non-champion enemies. If he catches an enemy champion, he will stop and hurl them out of his way.",
        "bodyHtml": "Urgot charges forward, gaining <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(55/75/95/115/135 + ([[si:scalead]]135% bonus Attack Damage) + ([[si:scalehealth]]13.5% bonus Health)) Shield</span> for 4 seconds. The first champion hit is <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stunned</span> for 1.5 seconds and thrown behind Urgot. All enemies Urgot collides with take <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(90/120/150/180/210 + ([[si:scalead]]100% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Cannot cross terrain.</span>",
